          },
          "description": "Discover five captivating Bible stories from the bestselling Tales that Tell the Truth series, that teach big Christian truths in a way kids can truly understand.  Each story brings the Bible to life with vibrant narration, engaging characters, and powerful gospel-centered messages. Whether it's the story of the very first Christmas, Jesus calming a storm, or the surprise of his return, every tale invites young listeners to know and trust God more.  \n\nIncluded Stories:  \n- The Christmas Promise – Discover the true king God promised long ago.  \n- God's Very Good Idea – Celebrate how God made everyone wonderfully different and how Jesus brings us together.  \n- The Storm That Stopped – Meet the man who has power over wind and waves.  \n- Goodbye to Goodbyes – A hope-filled story about Jesus giving life after death.  \n- Jesus and the Very Big Surprise – Find out what kind of king Jesus is, and why it’s the best news ever.  \n\nThis card is a wonderful addition to any family's audio library—perfect for car rides, quiet time, or bedtime listening.",
          "author": "Alison Mitchell, Lauren Chandler, Trillia J. Newbell, Randall Goodgame",
